>
>
> I've updated the Restarting a NIMBLE MCMC <http://danielturek.github.io/public/restartingMCMC/restartingMCMC.html> document.   There's one functional change in a new code block, near the end, which restores things into the compiled MCMC.  There's now also output at the end, showing the continued samples, and correct behaviour.  It should work without any problems now.
